   "cause": "For rambling patients, Voice._clear_yes outputs the 7-word phrase \"Yes, that's right, please go ahead.\", which exceeds explicit_confirm's 4-word limit and returns None. Because Arm F's consent_in_code=True design discards model \"yes\" answers and Driver.unclear hands off to staff after two unclear turns, the repeated clear confirmation escalates with nothing booked."
